# pnpm owns this file's formatting, and the two disagree: prettier writes double
# quotes and expands mappings, pnpm writes single quotes and collapses them. The
# pre-commit hook runs prettier over staged `.yaml`, so without this the lockfile
# is reformatted on commit and reformatted back on the next install — an
# eight-thousand-line diff that says nothing about what actually changed.
pnpm-lock.yaml
